WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From standing, step one foot back, both feet facing forward, hips square.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Place hands on hips or blocks beside the front foot.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Hinge forward over the front leg, keeping the spine long.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Draw the front-leg hip back to square the pelvis. Switch sides.
